  "body": "Is there any desire to move the Cookie Store API to WebApps WG?\r\nThe specification is a part of [WebApps WG charter](https://www.w3.org/2019/05/webapps-charter.html#wicgspecs), and will be shipping in [Chrome in M87](https://chromestatus.com/feature/5658847691669504).\r\n\r\nPrevious issue: https://github.com/WICG/cookie-store/issues/96 \r\n\r\n@marcoscaceres @LJWatson ",
